# Apps installed OUTSIDE Homebrew (NOT managed by `brew bundle`)
# ==============================================================================
# Manual downloads / self-updating apps (reinstall by hand on a new machine):
#   - OpenChamber        desktop app (drives the embedded opencode runtime)
#   - Dozer              menu-bar hider; moved over manually during migration
#   - CuaDriver          cua computer-use driver app bundle (nightly channel)
#   - Docker Desktop     Docker.app; installed via Docker's own installer
#   - Google Chrome      direct download / self-updating
#   - Visual Studio Code manual download; the `visual-studio-code` cask is NOT installed here
#   - IntelliJ IDEA      JetBrains Toolbox / direct (note: goland & pycharm ARE casks above)
#
# MDM / IT-managed (pushed by JumpCloud; do NOT install manually):
#   - CrowdStrike Falcon, JumpCloud (App / Remote Assist / Service Account), Okta Verify
#
# Apple preinstalled: Safari, GarageBand, iMovie
# App Store / third-party: Keynote/Numbers/Pages "Creator Studio" (Windows App is also a cask)
